      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/durant_mississippi",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Durant’s historic brick train depot, built in the 19th century, is slated for restoration to serve new community uses.",
